msgid "ReliefOS 文档"
msgstr "ReliefOS documentation"

msgid ""
"这里是 ReliefOS 的现行手册。按使用目的进入相应章节，命令均注明运行位置。 支持范围以实际实现为准；Linux ABI 编号或 POSIX 接口名称不代表完整标准认证。 内核内部实现由 "
"ReliefNT 独立文档说明，主仓手册负责用户态、桌面与系统集成。"
msgstr ""
"This is the current ReliefOS manual. Choose a section according to your task; commands state where"
" to run them. Support is limited to what is actually implemented; Linux ABI numbers and POSIX "
"interface names do not imply full standards certification. ReliefNT has separate documentation for"
" kernel internals; this repository's manual covers userspace, the desktop, and system integration."

msgid ""
"首次使用请阅读 :doc:`admin-guide/installation`；从源码构建请阅读 :doc:`kbuild/building`。已知限制集中在 :doc:`admin-"
"guide/limitations`。 历史过程记录由 Git 历史保存，不作为当前操作手册。"
msgstr ""
"For first-time use, read :doc:`admin-guide/installation`; to build from source, read "
":doc:`kbuild/building`. Known limitations are collected in :doc:`admin-guide/limitations`. "
"Historical development records are kept in Git history and are not part of the current operating "
"manual."
